WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.555
The scale sweep is the key ablation.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:05.849
On separable tasks accuracy rises with scale;

00:00:05.929 --> 00:00:09.583
on compose-by-step tasks it stays flat or degrades.

00:00:09.663 --> 00:00:14.487
Swapping simple-task demos for composite ones
recovers performance,

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:18.660
isolating composition, not capability, as the bottleneck.
